# Create a catalog under the temp folder, back it up, read it as CSV, then remove it.
# Running returns 6.
Allow reading files and writing files

An Item has a sku which is a string and a quantity which is an integer

When run, returning an integer
    the score is 0
    the folder is the combined path of the temp folder and "writ-sample-workshop"
    if the folder exists
        remove the folder and everything in it
    create the folder
    the file is the combined path of the folder and "catalog.csv"
    the text is "sku,quantity"
    save the text into the file
    the line is "pen,4"
    add the line to the file
    the line is "pad,2"
    add the line to the file
    the scratch is the combined path of the folder and "scratch.txt"
    the text is "temp"
    save the text into the scratch
    the moved is the combined path of the folder and "scratch-moved.txt"
    move the scratch to the moved
    the destination is the combined path of the folder and "catalog-backup.csv"
    copy the file to the destination
    the newname is "catalog-final.csv"
    rename the destination to the newname
    the path is the combined path of the folder and the newname
    the parent is the parent folder of the path
    the leaf is the file name of the path
    if the leaf is equal to "catalog-final.csv"
        increase the score
    if the length of the parent is greater than 0
        increase the score
    the full is the full path of the path
    the shown is the full as a string
    if the length of the shown is greater than 0
        increase the score
    the body is the contents of the file at the path
    if the body matches "pen"
        increase the score
    the data is the body as CSV
    the items are the data as a list of Item
    the pens are the items where the sku is equal to "pen"
    if the count of the items is equal to 2 and the count of the pens is equal to 1
        increase the score
    say "Catalog {the leaf} has {the count of the items} items"
    remove the folder and everything in it
    if the folder exists
        warn "The workshop folder is still there"
    otherwise
        increase the score
    return the score
